  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This townhouse is located in a 12 unit complex on the beach. It is just steps from the beautiful beaches of the Gulf of Mexico. Enjoy this cozy comfortable townhome for a long weekend or week long family vacation. The views of the gulf from the master bedroom are breathtaking. At night the stars shine over head as you relax on the deck off the master bedroom. There is room for 2 cars to park under the townhome and easy access to the laundry room on the carport level. Take time and cook your own meals or walk a few blocks to local restaurants. You can get up in the morning and walk to a coffee shop 2 blocks away. Relax and enjoy the beach",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "A Slice Of Paradise! Beautiful Ocean Views And Just Steps From The Beach"
        }
      ],
